1
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:22,960
The Council's emissary had been roaming through the desert for days on end. Here, at the roots of humanity, he was searching for a clue about how to defeat the dark shadows, the evil reaching out to the hearts of the humans and threatening to destroy them.

2
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:30,260
He had almost given up. When, at last, he found them.

3
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:33,260
The old writings the Council had talked of.

4
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:40,330
They were carved in stone, and told the stories of eight mighty buildings.

5
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:54,220
These wonders of the world had been erected eons ago, and tried to destroy them.

6
00:00:54,220 --> 00:01:02,400
A mighty power was concealed within them, a force which had once defeated the Shadows and banished them from the earth.

7
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:18,550
But in the course of the centuries, the wonders of the world had crumbled, and their powers, the emissary could only hope that the council knew what had to be done. Exhausted, he began to make his way.
